00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,981
You have never seen that happen, and you never will.

2
00:00:02,981 --> 00:00:08,437
But here is the puzzle: the backwards film conserves energy perfectly.

3
00:00:08,437 --> 00:00:10,911
The first law has no objection at all.

4
00:00:10,911 --> 00:00:12,122
So what forbids it?

5
00:00:12,122 --> 00:00:14,687
That is the second law of thermodynamics.

